    "title": {
      "en": "Mapping the Forex Market from Interbank Liquidity to Retail Execution",
      "zh": "从银行间流动性到零售执行的外汇市场结构"
    },
    "shortTitle": {
      "en": "forex",
      "zh": "从银行间流动性到零售执行的外汇市场结构"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This coursework evaluates how a learner explains, analyses and demonstrates mapping the forex market from interbank liquidity to retail execution using objective chart evidence, explicit invalidation and controlled risk.",
      "zh": "本课程作业评估学习者如何运用客观图表证据、明确失效条件与受控风险来解释、分析并展示从银行间流动性到零售执行的外汇市场结构。"
    },
