        "Apply mapping the forex market from interbank liquidity to retail execution to chart evidence without promising a trading outcome.",
        "Document invalidation and risk controls before demonstrating the skill."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "解释从银行间流动性到零售执行的外汇市场结构背后的核心决策规则。",
